---
source: crates/pgt-ddl/src/build/policy.rs
expression: out
---
# yalnız ad
[Safe] ALTER POLICY pol ON public.t RENAME TO yeni

# roller
[Safe] ALTER POLICY pol ON public.t TO a, b

# roller PUBLIC'e
[Safe] ALTER POLICY pol ON public.t TO PUBLIC

# using değişimi
[Safe] ALTER POLICY pol ON public.t USING (a > 1
)

# ad + using
[Safe] ALTER POLICY pol ON public.t RENAME TO yeni
[Safe] ALTER POLICY yeni ON public.t USING (a > 1
)

# komut değişimi
[Destructive] DROP POLICY pol ON public.t  -- Politika aynı transaction içinde yeniden kurulur.
[Safe] CREATE POLICY pol ON public.t AS PERMISSIVE FOR SELECT TO PUBLIC USING (a > 0
)
[Safe] COMMENT ON POLICY pol ON public.t IS 'c'

# permissive değişimi
[Destructive] DROP POLICY pol ON public.t  -- Politika aynı transaction içinde yeniden kurulur.
[Safe] CREATE POLICY pol ON public.t AS RESTRICTIVE FOR ALL TO PUBLIC USING (a > 0
)

# using kaldırma
[Destructive] DROP POLICY pol ON public.t  -- Politika aynı transaction içinde yeniden kurulur.
[Safe] CREATE POLICY pol ON public.t AS PERMISSIVE FOR ALL TO PUBLIC
WARN: İfadesiz politika: PERMISSIVE tüm satırlara izin verir, RESTRICTIVE etkisizdir.

# with check ekleme
[Safe] ALTER POLICY pol ON public.t WITH CHECK (b > 0
)

# using ekleme
[Safe] ALTER POLICY pol ON public.t USING (a > 0
)

# yorum
[Safe] COMMENT ON POLICY pol ON public.t IS 'it''s'

# yorum kaldırma
[Safe] COMMENT ON POLICY pol ON public.t IS NULL

# hepsi birden
[Safe] ALTER POLICY pol ON public.t RENAME TO yeni
[Safe] ALTER POLICY yeni ON public.t TO z USING (a > 2
) WITH CHECK (b > 2
)
[Safe] COMMENT ON POLICY yeni ON public.t IS 'c'
